%N A038316 Triangle whose (i,j)-th entry is binomial(i,j)*11^(i-j)*2^j.
%D A038316 B. N. Cyvin et al., Isomer enumeration of unbranched catacondensed polygonal systems with pentagons and heptagons, Match, No. 34 (Oct 1996), pp. 109-121.
%F A038316 T(n,k) = 2*T(n-1,k-1) + 11*T(n-1,k) with T(0,0)=1, T(n,k)=0 for k<0 or k>n. - _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Nov 10 2026
%e A038316 The triangle begins as:
%e A038316      1;
%e A038316     11,     2;
%e A038316    121,    44,    4;
%e A038316   1331,   726,  132,   8;
%e A038316  14641, 10648, 2904, 352, 16;
%e A038316  ...
%o A038316 (PARI) T(i, j)=binomial(i, j)*11^(i-j)*2^j;
%o A038316 tabl(nn) = for (n=0, nn, for (k=0, n, print1(T(n,k), ", "))); \\ _Michel Marcus_, Nov 10 2026
%Y A038316 Cf. A001022 (row sums), A000079 (main diagonal), A001020 (column k=0), A007318.
